rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">5</span><span class=\"tr\">5</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēn zhōng\" data-defn=\"minute\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">分钟</span><span class=\"tr\">分鐘</span><rt>fēn zhōng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ma\" data-defn=\"(question particle for &quot;yes-no&quot; questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby>？", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qí shí\" data-defn=\"actually; in fact; really\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">其实</span><span class=\"tr\">其實</span><rt>qí shí</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhǒng\" data-defn=\"classifier for types, kinds, sorts\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">种</span><span class=\"tr\">種</span><rt>zhǒng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qíng kuàng\" data-defn=\"circumstances; state of affairs; situation\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">情况</span><span class=\"tr\">情況</span><rt>qíng kuàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xià\" data-defn=\"down / downwards / below\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dào bù rú\" data-defn=\"it would be better to; had better than\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">倒不如</span><span class=\"tr\">倒不如</span><rt>dào bù rú</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" 