"de\" data-defn=\"-ly / structural particle: used before a verb or adjective, linking it to preceding modifying adverbial adjunct\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shuō\" data-defn=\"to speak; to talk; to say\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">&quot;</span><span class=\"tr\">&quot;</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chí dào\" data-defn=\"to arrive late\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">迟到</span><span class=\"tr\">遲到</span><rt>chí dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">1</span><span class=\"tr\">1</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"\" data-defn=\"\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">5</span><span class=\"tr\">5</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēn zhōng\" data-defn=\"minute\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">分钟</span><span class=\"tr\">分鐘</span><rt>fēn zhōng</rt></ruby>。”<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nà me\" data-defn=\"then; in that case\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">那么</span><span class=\"tr\">那麼</span><rt>nà me</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jí shǐ\" data-defn=\"even if; even though\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">即使</span><span class=\"tr\">即使</span><rt>jí shǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr